B: The `exists?` method expects parameter `tableName` to be `String`, but `org.apache.hadoop.hbase.security.access.AccessControlLists::ACL_TABLE_NAME` is of `org.apache.hadoop.hbase.TableName` form. The security capability check should pass the table name as a `String`, for example:
 {code}
