  exists?(org.apache.hadoop.hbase.security.access.AccessControlLists::ACL_TABLE_NAME.getNameAsString)
 {code}

 B: When a user runs a security related command such as `revoke` or `user_permission` and an exception such as `MasterNotRunning` occurs while checking security capabilities, the underlying exception is hidden. Instead of seeing the underlying exception, the user sees:
 {code}
 ERROR: no method 'valueOf' for arguments (org.apache.hadoop.hbase.TableName) on Java::OrgApacheHadoopHbase::TableName
  available overloads:
  (java.lang.String)
  (byte[])
 {code}

